OL,3,GNEWSA'Horrendous' stench as manure heap
OL,4,Aburns for days
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pile of poultry manure that has been
OL,7,Fburning for almost two weeks has caused
OL,8,Fa "horrendous" stench in parts of
OL,9,FNorwich and villages, a resident said.
OL,11,FThe muck heap on East Farm, near Newton
OL,12,FSt Faith, north of the city, has
OL,13,Fsmouldered since 19 September.
OL,15,FThe site's owners said they were using
OL,16,F"every practical resource available" to
OL,17,Fbring the fire under control, including
OL,18,Fefforts to redirect irrigation systems.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
